        "id": 1341996
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-08-23T17:06:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The caller of this method is not prepared to process error codes, and the implementation of this method never returns anything but zero.  So I think this one should be declared void, rather than giving the appearance that errors could be reported by return codes.",
